id: karmic-assault
name: Karmic Assault
kind: karma
cost: 2
manual: yes
takenAt: offered when an Ultimate Signature Technique is declared
description: >
  With every fiber of your being, you push a ton of extra power into your attack.
text: >
  If you use an Ultimate Signature Technique, you may apply a Super Profile
  of your choice to that Attacking Maneuver.

---

# No script: it is asked in code when an Ultimate Signature Technique is declared (use-maneuver.mjs
# `karmicAssault`), and shown greyed in the Respond dialog with where it is taken.
#
# The user's rulings: an Ascended Super counts as an Ultimate for it; not on an attack that already
# has a Super Profile (a Dramatic Finisher's, an Elemental Blade's); the Super Profile's KP is paid;
# its Prerequisites are read on the final attack as any Super Profile's are.
